# --- What the Arduino calls ---

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/device/electricity?voltage=230.1&current=1.5&power=340&energy=12.345&frequency=50&power_factor=0.95

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/device/water?flow_rate=4.5&total_volume=120.5

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/valve

###

# --- What the frontend calls ---

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/status

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/summary

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/electricity/history?interval=hour

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/water/history?interval=day&start=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&end=2026-11-08T00:00:00Z

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/valve
Content-Type: application/json

{"open": true}

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/valve/history

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tariffs

###

PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tariffs/electricity
Content-Type: application/json

{"price_per_unit": 0.20}

###

PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tariffs/water
Content-Type: application/json

{"price_per_unit": 1.50}
